        "sourceTextSha256": "414afe1c274a49ee8a665568611f40fcd9a26979254fb26da396ceac1124bc37",
        "text": "After breakfast, visit the Brazilian side of Iguazu Falls. Panoramic viewpoints overlook the cascades, tropical forest, clouds of spray and rainbows above the canyon. The name Iguazu means ‘big water’.\n\nNext is Macuco Safari: around 3 km through the jungle in an open vehicle with a guide, followed by a walk to the river and a motorboat ride close to the falls. Then visit the Bird Park, with spacious aviaries amid tropical greenery. All 3 visits are listed in the day's programme; ticket inclusions and the final price are confirmed when the quotation is prepared.",
